      "src": 1,
      "text": "Stage volume began very low and grew stronger over the first couple of songs",
      "type": "sound"
     },
     {
      "recording": "dac2021-09-15.AKGmix.toaste.flac16",
      "song": null,
      "song_key": null,
      "src": 1,
      "text": "Recorded with AKG shotgun, figure-8, cardioid and omni mics into a Zoom F8 at 44.1kHz/16-bit; taper's sixth show of the run",
      "type": "lineage"
     },
     {
      "recording": null,
      "song": null,
      "song_key": null,
      "src": 1,
      "text": "Fireworks set off in the parking lot can be heard about 4:12 into Drums; Oteil played drums there",
      "type": "scene"
     },
     {
      "recording": "deadco2021-09-15.deadco2021-09-15",
      "song": null,
      "song_key": null,
      "src": 2,
      "text": "Mixed into six channels: front, center plus subwoofer, and rear; rear derived from front mix with phase reversed for separation",
      "type": "lineage"
     },
     {
      "recording": "deadco2021-09-15.deadco2021-09-15",
      "song": null,
      "song_key": null,
      "src": 2,
      "text": "Frequencies below roughly 60Hz were cut about 6dB with a multiband EQ to remove harsh low end from side mics",
      "type": "sound"
     },
     {
      "recording": null,
      "song": "Big Railroad Blues",
      "song_key": "song:grateful-dead:big-railroad-blues",
      "src": 6,
      "text": "Reviewer singles out the first-set Big Railroad Blues as a highlight",
      "type": "song"
     },
     {
      "recording": null,
      "song": null,
      "song_key": null,
      "src": 6,
      "text": "During set break the reviewer and another fan stargazed and saw a cloud resembling Jerry's face beneath the moon",
      "type": "scene"
     },
     {
      "recording": null,
      "song": null,
      "song_key": null,
      "src": 7,
      "text": "Reviewer notes the second set covered nearly all of the Live Dead album, minus the closing Bid You Goodnight",
      "type": "compare"
     },
     {
      "recording": null,
      "song": null,
      "song_key": null,
      "src": 7,
      "text": "Long entry line and a phone ticket problem meant reviewer arrived during Brown-Eyed Women, missing about half the first set",
      "type": "scene"
     },
     {
      "recording": null,
      "song": "St. Stephen",
      "song_key": "song:grateful-dead:saint-stephen",
      "src": 7,
      "text": "Reviewer found it spectacular, lacking the usual mid-song interlude, with the band riding the rhythm",
      "type": "song"
     },
